---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About Kristen" description="Meet Kristen Dean, the caregiver and author behind Caring for My Caregivers.">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Hi, I'm Kristen.</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead">I started Caring for My Caregivers because I know how lonely and overwhelming it can feel to care for someone you love who is living with dementia or Alzheimer's.</p>
      <p>Caregiving changes everything: your days, your family, and sometimes your sense of who you are. Through it all, I have learned that small kindnesses, a little humor, and faith can carry us further than we ever expected.</p>
      <p>This site is a place to share what I've learned: practical tips, encouragement for hard days, and the resources I wish every family knew about. It is also home to the adventures of Grandma Rose and her granddaughter Lily, stories I created to help parents gently explain memory loss to their children.</p>
      <p>I am also the author of <em>Grandma Remembers Jesus: A Gentle Story of Alzheimer's, Family, and God's Unforgettable Love</em>.</p>
      <p>Whether you're just starting this journey or have been walking it for years, I'm so glad you're here.</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href="/contact">Get in touch</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
